[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（２８３プロダクションに入社して数か月……\r\nいよいよ俺が、アイドルをプロデュースする時が来た）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bg": "00001",
    "bgm": "001"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ずっと憧れていた仕事をようやく任されたんだ、\r\nこれから精一杯頑張るぞ！）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おはようございます！\r\nって、天井社長……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010010,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "おはよう、お前を待っていたぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1902001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（この２８３プロダクションを束ねる\r\n天井社長……あいかわらずダンディな雰囲気だ）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010020,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "お前には今日から、アイドルを\r\nプロデュースしてもらうと伝えていたが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1902001010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010030,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "素晴らしい結果を期待させてもらう\r\n私は甘くないぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1902001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "は、はい！　よろしくお願いします！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010040,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "よろしい。では、仕事の説明ははづきに任せて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1902001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "？　はづきさんはどこにも……あっ！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（そ、ソファの裏で誰かが倒れてる！？）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010010,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "……ふわぁ～？\r\nなんですか～急に大きな声出して～……",
    "charAnim1": "sleep1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "charType": "sub_characters",
    "charId": "staff",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1901001010010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010050,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "は、はづき……なぜ床で寝ているんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1902001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010020,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "すみません、ソファへ着く前に\r\n眠気に負けてしまいまして～……",
    "charAnim1": "sleep2",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1901001010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010060,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "せっかくまじめな雰囲気を出したというのに……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1902001010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010070,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "……ともかく！\r\n彼に仕事の説明をしてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1902001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010030,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "はい、もちろんです\r\nプロデューサーさん、どうぞ～",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1901001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとうございます\r\n……あいかわらず、わかりやすくまとまってますね、資料",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（はづきさん、こういうところは頼れるんだよな……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010040,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ありがとうございます\r\nそれじゃあ、さっそくお仕事の説明に入りますね～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1901001010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010050,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "まず、今回のプロデュースの目標についてですが……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1901001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010060,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ワンダーアイドルノヴァ・グランプリ……\r\n通称『W.I.N.G.』への出場を目指してください",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1901001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『W.I.N.G.』……ですか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010070,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "はい\r\n新人アイドルの祭典とも言われる、すごいライブなんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1901001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010080,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "祭典と言われるだけあって、この『W.I.N.G.』は\r\n出場資格を手に入れるまでが厳しいんです……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1901001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010090,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "エントリーしたアイドルは開催前まで、\r\n全４回のシーズンごとに審査を受けます",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1901001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010100,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "その時、一定のランクに達していないと、\r\n出場資格を失ってしまうんです",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1901001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010110,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ですので、精一杯頑張っていきましょ～！\r\n私もたくさんサポートさせていただきますね～",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1901001010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010080,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "……少しアドバイスをしておくが、\r\nお前は、２８３プロダクションのプロデューサーだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1902001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010090,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "担当アイドルと他のアイドルたちを\r\n交流させることも重要になってくる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1902001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010100,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "互いに影響しあうことで目指せる高みもあるだろう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1902001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010110,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "まあ、まずは思うようにやってみるといい\r\n結果がついてくるかは、お前とアイドルの頑張り次第だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1902001010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010120,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "では、そろそろお仕事に移ってもらいましょうか\r\n今回プロデュースするアイドルは──",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1901001010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "bgm": "fade_out",
    "effectLabel": "black99",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "000000"
    },
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "from",
      "x": 1000,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000
    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "bg": "00014"
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "black99",
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000,
      "easing": "easeInQuart"
    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──ええと……\r\n福丸小糸さん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001010010,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ぴゃ……！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "022",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "bgm": "015",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1022001010010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001010020,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "え、あ、えっと……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1022001010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなに緊張しなくても大丈夫だよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001010030,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "………………",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1022001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "普段どおり答えてくれればそれでいいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあ、まずはアイドルを志望したきっかけ……\r\n２８３プロに応募してくれた理由を教えてもらえるかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001010040,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "………………",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1022001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "福丸さん？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001010050,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………み、みんなと……\r\n一緒に………………",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1022001010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうか\r\n君の幼馴染も２８３プロに所属してくれたんだったね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "幼馴染同士、仲がいいなあ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001010060,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………！",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1022001010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001010070,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "わ、わかりますか……？\r\nそうなんです……！　すごく仲良しなんです……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1022001010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……はは、うん、わかるよ\r\nみんな一緒に活動していけたらいいユニットになりそうだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001010080,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "えへへ……そうなんです……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1022001010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあ、その中で君自身は\r\nどんなアイドルになりたい？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "fade_out"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001010090,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "え……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1022001010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "幼馴染のことを抜きにして\r\n君がやりたいことや、なりたいアイドル像はある？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001010100,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "………………\r\nなりたい……アイドル……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1022001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001010110,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "………………",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1022001010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……少し難しかったかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001010120,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "あ……えと…………",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1022001010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001010130,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "わ、わたしは……えっと……",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1022001010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──それじゃあ、福丸小糸さん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001010140,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ぴゃい……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1022001010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "アイドルの活動をやっていく中で\r\nどんなアイドルになりたいか、考えてもらえるかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それがまず２８３プロに所属するアイドルとして、\r\n君の一番最初の課題だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001010150,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "………………えっ！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1022001010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これからよろしく頼む",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "005"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001010160,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………！\r\nはいっ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200101/1022001010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、それと最後にひとつ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
